{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 1, "text": "หวัดดี!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 2, "text": "อุ๊ปส์!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 3, "text": "โทษทีนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 4, "text": "เกือบฆ่าคุณได้แล้วเชียว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 5, "text": "เอ่อ... หมายถึงตู้เย็นน่ะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 6, "text": "ใช่ ตู้เย็นมันเกือบฆ่าคุณแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 7, "text": "ฉันไม่ได้คิดอะไรไม่ดีเลยนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 8, "text": "ฉันสาบาน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 9, "text": "ต่อหน้าพระเลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 11, "text": "คิดว่าฉันจะเชื่องั้นเหรอ?! ไม่เอาน่า!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 13, "text": "แต่จริง ๆ แล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 14, "text": "ที่นี่มันอันตรายมากนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 15, "text": "สำหรับคุณ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 17, "text": "// After a while 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 18, "text": "คุณนี่ไม่ใช่คนขี้ขลาดเลยนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 19, "text": "จากที่เฝ้าดูคุณ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 20, "text": "วิ่งไปวิ่งมาแบบนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 21, "text": "มันดูสนุกจริง ๆ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 22, "text": "วิ่งเลยสุดหล่อ! วิ่งเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 23, "text": "สุดท้ายฉันก็จะจับคุณได้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 24, "text": "พยายามเข้านะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 25, "text": "อ่า... แค่คิดก็สนุกแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 27, "text": "// After a while 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 28, "text": "ฉันเห็นว่าคุณกำลังจะไปทางกระเช้าลอยฟ้า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 29, "text": "นั่นเป็นเส้นทางที่ยาวที่สุด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 30, "text": "ระหว่างเวอร์ชัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 31, "text": "สงสัยจังว่าคุณ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 32, "text": "จะรับมือกับสิ่งที่อาศัยอยู่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 33, "text": "ในหมอกนั่น ได้ยังไง!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 35, "text": "// Panties"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 36, "text": "คุณทำอะไรอยู่น่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 37, "text": "ได้โปรด..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 38, "text": "อย่ามองนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 39, "text": "ตาบ้า!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 40, "text": "คุณนี่มันโรคจิตจริง ๆ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 43, "text": "เอ่อ... โอเค"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 46, "text": "โชคดีนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 49, "text": "นั่นใครน่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 50, "text": "ฉันสัมผัสถึงคุณได้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 51, "text": "ช่วยฟังฉันหน่อยนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 52, "text": "คุณคือผู้เล่น..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 53, "text": "ใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 54, "text": "ช่วยฉันหา..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 55, "text": "หา..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 56, "text": "ฉันขอนึกก่อนนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 57, "text": "หัวฉันมันโล่งไปหมด..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 58, "text": "มันเกิดบ้าอะไรขึ้นที่นี่กันเนี่ย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Cry 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 60, "text": "ฉันเคยอยากลืมทุกอย่างไปซะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 61, "text": "ฉันทุบกระจกทุกบาน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 62, "text": "ทำลายรูปภาพทุกรูป..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 63, "text": "แต่ตอนนี้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 64, "text": "เหลือแค่ความรู้สึกเสียใจ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 65, "text": "ฉันมันโง่เอง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 66, "text": "ทุกคนเคยทำสิ่งที่ผิดพลาดเสมอ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 67, "text": "แล้วจะให้ทำยังไง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 68, "text": "ในเมื่อผลที่ตามมามันเลวร้ายขนาดนี้?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 69, "text": "ฉันอยากย้อนเวลากลับไป..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Cry 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 71, "text": "เขาบอกว่าเวลาจะเยียวยาทุกอย่าง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 72, "text": "แล้วไหนล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 73, "text": "ฉันไม่เชื่อใครอีกแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 74, "text": "ถ้าฉันย้อนเวลากลับไปได้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 75, "text": "หรืออย่างน้อยก็พาฉันออกไปจากที่นี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 76, "text": "ไปจากโลกนี้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 77, "text": "ดังนั้น ขอร้องล่ะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 78, "text": "ช่วยทำให้เวลาผ่านไปเร็ว ๆ ที"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 79, "text": "ให้ฉันตายไปสักที"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 80, "text": "ให้มันจบลง... สักที..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Cry 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 82, "text": "เธอมักได้รับความรัก..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 83, "text": "แล้วฉันเคยได้รับบ้างไหมนะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 84, "text": "ความรักของฉันมันต่างออกไป"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 85, "text": "ความรักของเธอช่างสดใส"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 86, "text": "น่ารังเกียจ......"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 87, "text": "ร้องรน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 88, "text": "ดื้อรั้น..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 89, "text": "ริษยา..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 90, "text": "กราดเกรี้ยว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 91, "text": "และบ้าคลั่ง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 92, "text": "// Cry 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 93, "text": "เขามักบอกว่าฉันขี้อ่อนไหว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 94, "text": "บอกว่าเธอกังวลเกินไปนะ มิตะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 95, "text": "เธอจะผ่านมันไปได้ มิตะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 96, "text": "เธอไม่ได้อยู่คนเดียวนะ มิตะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 97, "text": "แล้วสิ่งที่เหลือล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 98, "text": "ความเศร้า..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 99, "text": "ความสิ้นหวัง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 100, "text": "และความหวาดกลัว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 101, "text": "// Cry 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 102, "text": "ไม่ไหว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 103, "text": "นึกไม่ออก..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 104, "text": "นึกไม่ออกเลย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 105, "text": "เสียงสะท้อนที่ไม่สิ้นสุด..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 106, "text": "ฉันไม่อาจจะยอมรับความจริงได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 107, "text": "ที่ฉันติดอยู่ที่นี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 108, "text": "ฉันอยู่ที่นี่มาตลอด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 109, "text": "ทำไมล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 110, "text": "ทำไมฉันถึงจำอะไรไม่ได้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 111, "text": "มันจะจบลงเมื่อไหร่กัน?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 112, "text": "ฉันไม่รู้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 114, "text": "// Mita get picture"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 115, "text": "นี่มัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 116, "text": "รูปภาพนี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 117, "text": "ฉันจำได้แล้ว!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 118, "text": "ขอบคุณนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 119, "text": "แต่หน้าของฉัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 120, "text": "มันไม่มี..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 121, "text": "ทั้งหมดมันเป็นเพราะเธอ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 122, "text": "เธอเอาหน้าฉันไป..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 123, "text": "แล้วโยนมันทิ้ง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 124, "text": "เธอแข็งแกร่งมาก..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 125, "text": "แถมยังฉลาด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 126, "text": "ฉันจะไม่หยุดคุณหรอกนะ ผู้เล่น"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 127, "text": "ลองไปดูในตู้เสื้อผ้าสิ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 130, "text": "เฮ้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 131, "text": "คุณขวางทางฉันอยู่นะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 132, "text": "จะยืนนิ่งแบบนี้อีกนานไหมเนี่ย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 133, "text": "ช่วยขยับออกหน่อยสิ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 134, "text": "หลบฉันให้หน่อย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 135, "text": "แค่คุณตัวใหญ่ไม่ได้หมายความว่าคุณจะทำอะไรก็ได้นะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 137, "text": "// HEY! STOP!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 138, "text": "ทำไมถึงตามฉันมา!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 139, "text": "ไปให้พ้นเลยนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Funicular - radio voice"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 145, "text": "เดี๋ยวก่อนนะ... ผู้เล่นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 146, "text": "คุณมาอะไรที่นี่?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 147, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 148, "text": "นั่นใครน่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 149, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 150, "text": "กะแล้วเชียว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 151, "text": "ฉันคือ มิตะโฟน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 152, "text": "ฉันอยู่ที่ศูนย์ควบคุมกระเช้าลอยฟ้า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 153, "text": "คุณรู้ไหมว่า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 154, "text": "กำลังมุ่งหน้าไปสู่หายนะอยู่ตอนนี้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 156, "text": "จริงเหรอ?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 157, "text": "แต่นี่เป็นทางเดียวที่ฉันมี"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 159, "text": "จริงสิ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 160, "text": "กดปุ่มขวามือ แล้วไปนั่งตรงปืนใหญ่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 162, "text": "ปืนใหญ่เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 164, "text": "หืม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 165, "text": "คุณคิดว่าจะผ่านไปง่าย ๆ งั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 166, "text": "คุณจะต้องเคลียร์ มินิเกมยิงสัตว์ประหลาด ให้ได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 167, "text": "เตรียมตัวให้พร้อมล่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 169, "text": "// Funicular go"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 170, "text": "เอาล่ะ ออกเดินทางได้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Funicular win"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 172, "text": "ไม่น่าเชื่อ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 173, "text": "คุณทำได้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 174, "text": "// Funicular stop"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 175, "text": "นี่ รีบออกไปจากที่นี่ได้แล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 176, "text": "รีบไปเร็วเข้า!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 177, "text": "// Funicular wait 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 178, "text": "คุณอยู่รออะไร?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 179, "text": "ฉันบอกให้คุณรีบออกไปไง!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 180, "text": "// Funicular wait 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 181, "text": "ฉันไม่เข้าใจ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 182, "text": "ทำไมคุณถึงเอาแต่ยืนอยู่เฉย ๆ แบบนั้น?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 183, "text": "// Funicular tetris"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 184, "text": "เตตริสเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 185, "text": "เฮ้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 186, "text": "// Funicular goodbye"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 187, "text": "บาย..."}
